# Studio and Windows launch

Status: DONE
Milestone: M1
Dependencies: 02_CAMERA_INPUT.todo, 03_BODY_FACE_TRACKING.todo, 04_SYNTHETIC_STAGE.todo

## Purpose
Make the prototype usable without source edits or a console-only debugging workflow.

## Tasks
- [x] Native connection panel, mirrored stage, tracking/face diagnostics and safe controls.
- [x] Clearly labelled no-camera demonstration; never substitute it for live evidence.
- [x] Isolated setup, verified model downloads, CLI and Windows launch scripts.

## Acceptance criteria
- [x] Documented setup and launch commands work; invalid input and missing models have actionable errors.

## Completion evidence
- Setup-TrickRoom.ps1 completed; both model checksums verified; wheel built locally.
- Ten native groups include actual-model synthetic replay, EOF controls and complete shutdown.
- CLI3-second demo:90 rendered frames, clean shutdown; no-source headless exits2 as expected.
- PowerShell sharing copies match byte-for-byte. Actual camera address is entered privately by owner.

